title: Stripe webhook
description: Receives subscription events from Stripe and records each workspace's plan, and emails the operator a summary of each day when the cron asks. The only code that runs without a signed-in user.
connects:
  - to: src/lib/billing
    label: subscription events
    description: Stripe signs each event; the handler verifies the signature, then writes the subscription's state to the workspace's plan with the server's secret key. Everything else in the app reads that plan through row-level security.
